  "plain": "In 2011, at a spot in the Baltic Sea where a diving team had found a strange object on the seafloor, thunder, lightning and other odd weather struck right over the site. That is the account of a treasure hunter named Dennis Asberg, who was there, and who describes \"thunder and lots of things just on the spot.\" If it happened as he says, the weather itself would seem tied to the object below."
